Well, as a quick fix until I investigate further (or more likely someone else does :) change the lines in initx.c where the black and white pixels are defined  to....
 	whitepixel = BlackPixel(display, screen);
        	blackpixel = WhitePixel(display, screen);

This gives you a white background with a black guy,  Not wonderfull I know, but I did say it was quick!

